    "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nWhen running a `gh search code` query with a limit of 1000, I get a 403 rate limit even when its the only command ran in the last few minutes.\n\nInternal ticket ref: https://support.github.com/ticket/3220625\n\nFor example: \n\n```\ngh search code  --limit 1000 \"apples\" --json path,repository,sha,url,textMatches\nHTTP 403: API rate limit exceeded for user ID 134870110. If you reach out to GitHub Support for help, please include the request ID 88C6:1A2E22:10B4B47:217EF0D:67ACE5F7 and timestamp 2025-02-12 18:18:31 UTC. (https://api.github.com/search/code?page=10&per_page=100&q=apples)\n```\n\n\n### Affected version\n\n```\ngh version\ngh version 2.66.1 (2025-01-31)\nhttps://github.com/cli/cli/releases/tag/v2.66.1\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce the behavior\n\n1. Run `gh search code  --limit 1000 \"apples\" --json path,repository,sha,url,textMatches` with a token that hasn't been used in the last minute.\n\n### Expected vs actual behavior\n\nExpected: 1000 code search results since we should be able to get the max allowed by the cli.\nActual: 403 Rate limit.\n\n### Logs\n\nPaste the activity from your command line. Redact if needed.\n\n```\ncmachalo@cmachalo-mn2:~ 1 $ gh api rate_limit | jq .resources.code_search\n{\n  \"limit\": 10,\n  \"used\": 0,\n  \"remaining\": 10,\n  \"reset\": 1739384621\n}\ncmachalo@cmachalo-mn2:~ $ GH_DEBUG=true gh search code  --limit 1000 \"apples\" --json path,repository,sha,url,textMatches\n\u28fe* Request at 2025-02-12 10:22:44.312011 -0800 PST m=+0.074514959\n* Request to https://api.github.com/search/code?page=1&per_page=100&q=apples\n\u28df* Request took 581.272125ms\n\u28f7* Request at 2025-02-12 10:22:45.143972 -0800 PST m=+0.906478126\n* Request to https://api.github.com/search/code?page=2&per_page=100&q=apples\n\u28fb* Request took 409.848125ms\n\u28bf* Request at 2025-02-12 10:22:45.621802 -0800 PST m=+1.384310293\n* Request to https://api.github.com/search/code?page=3&per_page=100&q=apples\n\u28ef* Request took 442.952458ms\n\u28f7* Request at 2025-02-12 10:22:46.128665 -0800 PST m=+1.891174209\n* Request to https://api.github.com/search/code?page=4&per_page=100&q=apples\n\u28fb* Request took 426.178334ms\n\u28bf* Request at 2025-02-12 10:22:46.623814 -0800 PST m=+2.386324834\n* Request to https://api.github.com/search/code?page=5&per_page=100&q=apples\n\u28ef* Request took 418.144292ms\n\u28f7* Request at 2025-02-12 10:22:47.108584 -0800 PST m=+2.871095459\n* Request to https://api.github.com/search/code?page=6&per_page=100&q=apples\n\u28fb* Request took 344.157167ms\n* Request at 2025-02-12 10:22:47.513493 -0800 PST m=+3.276006459\n* Request to https://api.github.com/search/code?page=7&per_page=100&q=apples\n\u28f7* Request took 604.195167ms\n\u28fe* Request at 2025-02-12 10:22:48.185043 -0800 PST m=+3.947557793\n* Request to https://api.github.com/search/code?page=8&per_page=100&q=apples\n\u28bf* Request took 441.006125ms\n\u287f* Request at 2025-02-12 10:22:48.688961 -0800 PST m=+4.451477584\n* Request to https://api.github.com/search/code?page=9&per_page=100&q=apples\n\u28f7* Request took 366.310625ms\n\u28fe* Request at 2025-02-12 10:22:49.127068 -0800 PST m=+4.889585168\n* Request to https://api.github.com/search/code?page=10&per_page=100&q=apples\n\u28fd* Request took 149.3595ms\nHTTP 403: API rate limit exceeded for user ID 134870110. If you reach out to GitHub Support for help, please include the request ID 9CDE:2ED39F:28EBC27:5228469:67ACE6F9 and timestamp 2025-02-12 18:22:49 UTC. (https://api.github.com/search/code?page=10&per_page=100&q=apples)\ncmachalo@cmachalo-mn2:~ 1 $ gh api rate_limit | jq .resources.code_search\n{\n  \"limit\": 10,\n  \"used\": 10,\n  \"remaining\": 0,\n  \"reset\": 1739384624\n}\n```\n",
